  "label": "User projected onto the woman as the victim",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the woman (visual material) through the explicit deictic pronoun 'me' in the text 'this victimizes me'. This deictic anchors the user's identification with the woman as the victim, creating a direct semiotic projection where the viewer sees themselves as the subject of victimization described in the text. The woman's visual expression and posture reinforce this projection by embodying the state of being victimized.",
